      "id": "claim_b8ba8219f5c84f8c9f665b4002f0bf6d",
      "statement": "After registration, any agent can use a tool by declaring it under tools: in its own agent.yaml; the engine generates the model-facing function schema from the ToolSpec, and the model decides when to call it.",
